<title>INDIA: Bombay bourse start delayed further.</title>
<headline>Bombay bourse start delayed further.</headline>
<text>
<p>The Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) will get off to a delayed start on Monday due to a power crisis at the bourse.</p>
<p>BSE officials had earlier expected trading to resume around 10.30 a.m. (0500 GMT), but the start has been further delayed.</p>
<p>No time has yet been fixed, officials said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
